#heading(level: 1)[Adult Mods]

This chapter covers adult-oriented mods. Content separated from the main guide.
#heading(level: 2)[Adult]

#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/14207-carnalitas-unified-sex-mod-framework-for-ck3/")[Carnalitas Unlocked]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None | *Dependencies:* Carnalitas]]]
*System Impact:* Social — additional adult events, interactions, and scenarios beyond base Carnalitas

*Gameplay Impact:* More depth to Carnalitas content. Adds events and scenarios the base framework doesn't touch.

*Installation:* Install after Carnalitas. Check LoversLab for the latest Unlocked-specific download if separate from the main framework.

*Incompatibilities:* None (builds on Carnalitas)

*Configuration:* Inherits Carnalitas game rules

#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2914776612")[Carnalitas Body Optimization (CBO)]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[[*Load Order:* After Carnalitas | *Essential:* No (requires Carnalitas) | *Performance:* Minor | *Dependencies:* Carnalitas]]]
*System Impact:* Visual — body type customization, physical attributes, character model enhancement

*Gameplay Impact:* Enables body customization and physical trait inheritance. Required for mods like Physical Attributes Lite.

*Installation:* Install after Carnalitas. Required by Physical Attributes Lite and other body-dependent adult mods.

*Incompatibilities:* Other body/figure mods

*Configuration:* Inherits Carnalitas game rules

#heading(level: 3)[#link("https://www.loverslab.com/files/file/37247-physical-attributes-lite/")[Physical Attributes Lite]]
#block(below: 0.5em)[#text(size: 9pt, fill: rgb("#666666"))[[*Load Order:* After CBO | *Essential:* No (requires CBO and Carnalitas) | *Performance:* None | *Dependencies:* Carnalitas, Carnalitas Body Optimization (CBO)]]]
*System Impact:* Genetics — inherited physical traits (genitalia size, breast size, height, weight, lactation)

*Gameplay Impact:* Physical traits become inheritable character features. Adds a new visual and gameplay dimension to character genetics. Compatible with CBO's body framework.

*Installation:* Install after both Carnalitas and CBO. Compatible with CBO's body framework.

*Incompatibilities:* The full Physical Attributes mod (this is the Lite version)

*Configuration:* Inherits Carnalitas game rules

